{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "長崎県出身18歳\n四期生の中川智尋です(  . .)\""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobcweZg7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "\"Lonesome rabbit\"\nMUSIC VIDEOが公開されました！\n先行配信もスタートしています🐰"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とってもカッコよくて大好きな曲です\nこの制作に参加させていただけていることが幸せです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobQHpAB3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかくにとそっくりな新入りが増えました🐾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなしかくにしか興味がなくて可愛がらないので、可哀想でういたんと新入りの面倒を見ていました…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この写真はお弁当を選んでいる間、\nこのみに犬たちを預けている図です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これから愛されるようになるといいね(‥ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また写真整理できたら載せます📷 ́͏̖-"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14thSingle ペアミーグリ\nありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobT4RjCP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぎさんと(  . .)♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハの疲れが吹き飛ぶくらい、とっても楽しい時間でした！なぎさんファンのみなさんありがとうございました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四期生ライブ行くよー！や\nツアー楽しみにしてるねー！という声をいただいたので、また頑張れそうです🫢"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "30、31日のミーグリもよろしくね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}], "source": "official"}